        'Suppresses the <link rel="EditURI"> tag used by legacy XML-RPC clients for endpoint auto-discovery.' => 'Rimuove il tag <link rel="EditURI"> usato dai client XML-RPC legacy per il rilevamento automatico dell’endpoint.',
